2) Crystal Dock remains desktop-scoped but loses the dead `LABWC_ENABLE_CRYSTAL_DOCK` policy path and its brittle per-user config condition, relying on the installer’s staged XDG defaults;  
3) tests will lock both contracts in place.  
I’m applying that focused source-and-test patch now.

